  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Place the headered Pico",
      "text": "No batteries or USB yet. With the USB socket at the top, insert its left header into c3\u2013c22 and right header into h3\u2013h22. The board bridges the centre trench. Pin 1 is c3; pin 40 is h3. Keep all side power rails unused."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Build the Pico supply and ground",
      "text": "Fit D1 a30\u2192a35, stripe at a35. Add J1 b35\u2192j4 and J2 c50\u2192j5. Prepare L1 b30\u2192external 5 V and L2 a50\u2192external GND, but leave their source ends disconnected until voltage checks. These feed VSYS and GND; h3/VBUS stays unused."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Add battery sensing",
      "text": "Fit R_TOP a40\u2192a45, R_BOTTOM b45\u2192b50, C_ADC e45\u2192e46. Add J7 d46\u2192d50, J6 d45\u2192j12 and prepare L3 b40\u2192PACK_SW. The five holes a45\u2013e45 form the ADC junction. The capacitor bridges adjacent rows, not the same row."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Add gate control and first servo signal",
      "text": "Fit R_EN a55\u2192a60 and R_PWM0 f30\u2192f35. Add J8 b60\u2192e50, J3 b22\u2192b55 and J4 j22\u2192j30. Prepare L4 c55\u2192gate ON and L5 j35\u2192servo 0 signal. Keep servo power and ground on the separate power harness."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Optional second servo",
      "text": "For two switches, add R_PWM1 f40\u2192f45, J5 j21\u2192j40 and L6 j45\u2192servo 1 signal. Omit all three for the first one-servo build."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Check, then connect power",
      "text": "With all power removed, check every listed hole and jumper, then lift out the Pico for voltage checks. Connect the external harness and L1/L2/L3 with both servos unplugged. Check regulated 5 V at c30, the diode output at c35, and the ADC voltage at c45 relative to c60. The build guide gives the expected ranges. Switch off and unplug batteries before reinstalling the Pico; then test one unloaded servo with the gate slider OFF."
    }
  ],
